    allowInternalIngress : bool, default is True, optional
        Allow traffic between workloads inside the network. AWS opens all protocols from cidr on the workload security group; GCP creates an equivalent ingress Firewall rule. Turning this off leaves the group/rule empty, so nothing inside the network can talk to anything else.
    availabilityZones : [str], default is Undefined, optional
