        AWS-only — also create an RDS DB subnet group and an ElastiCache subnet group over the private subnets, published as status.dbSubnetGroupName and status.cacheSubnetGroupName. This is what a PostgresInstance or RedisInstance attaches to. Ignored by GCP, which attaches by network instead.
